### CLIENTES (CUSTOMER) - SERVICE.HTTP (LOCAL)
### Estas peticiones pasan por el API Gateway (puerto 3000) y se enrutan al microservicio por Redis.

@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@contentType = application/json

### 1. Flujo Unificado Completo (Crear/Consultar Cliente + Simular Oferta + Crear Solicitud)
POST {{host}}/customers/apply
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "customerData": {
    "firstName": "María",
    "lastName": "Gómez",
    "document": "111111111",
    "email": "maria.gomez@ejemplo.com",
    "phone": "3001234567"
  },
  "offerResult": {
    "isPreApproved": true,
    "maxAmount": 50000000,
    "interestRate": 1.5,
    "termMonths": 60,
    "monthlyPayment": 1200000
  }
}

### 2. Crear un Cliente (Directo)
POST {{host}}/customers
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "firstName": "Juan",
  "lastName": "Pérez",
  "document": "999999999",
  "email": "juan.perez@ejemplo.com",
  "phone": "3109876543"
}
